flowchart LR
  CP[Connected Papers discovery layer] --> NF[FARTrack neighborhood: 41 records]
  CP --> NS[SpikeTrack neighborhood: 41 records]
  NF --> INV[82 raw records -> 74 verified unique papers]
  NS --> INV
  INV --> TAX[Multi-label solution families]

  TAX --> STATIC[Static reduction: depth, width, backbone, resolution]
  TAX --> DYNAMIC[Temporal/input reduction: sparsity, reuse, timestep]
  TAX --> PRESERVE[Information preservation: distillation, memory, robustness]
  TAX --> REP[Representation/training: autoregression, SNN, losses]

  FAR[[FARTrack\nANCHOR: design knowledge]]
  SPIKE[[SpikeTrack\nANCHOR: redesign target]]
  STATIC --> FAR
  DYNAMIC --> FAR
  REP --> SPIKE
  PRESERVE --> SPIKE

  FAR --> PRINCIPLES[Transferable principles\ntask-facing distillation\ntemporal amortization\nconservative sparsity]
  DONORS[Other trackers\nknowledge donors only] --> PRINCIPLES
  PRINCIPLES --> MATRIX[Evidence-scoped transfer matrix]
  SPIKE --> MATRIX
  MATRIX --> SPACE[First-pass SpikeTrack redesign space]
  SPACE --> REVIEW[Manager review\nno third baseline\nno final architecture]

  NULL[Historical whole-MRM1 conditional skip\nDIAG_FAIL; sealed hold-out consumed] -. excluded active path .-> SPACE

  classDef anchor fill:#ffe599,stroke:#7f6000,stroke-width:3px;
  classDef guard fill:#f4cccc,stroke:#990000,stroke-width:2px;
  class FAR,SPIKE anchor;
  class NULL,REVIEW guard;
